<p>You empower your spells with dangerous levels of entropic energy, increasing your darkness and temporal damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 8%, 11%, 13%, 15%</acronym> and resistance penetration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 12%, 16%, 20%, 24%</acronym> at the cost of suffering <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> entropic backlash for each non-instant spell.</p>